      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 65,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.24807_p4_b2",
      "text": "that adapting the semantic guide is critical, whereas additional tuning of\nthe SAM backbone yields diminishing returns.\n\u2013 We propose a train-test prompt alignment strategy for text-only segmen-\n",
      "bbox": [
        140.99,
        129.98,
        480.61,
        163.57
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        563,
        519,
        1922,
        654
      ],
      "coord_space": "pdf_points",
      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "SFRM1000",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 193,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.24807_p4_b3",
      "text": "tation that improves robustness by matching training and inference prompt\ndistributions.\n\u2013 We present a parameter-efficient system applicable to both general and spe-\n",
      "bbox": [
        140.99,
        165.56,
        480.57,
        199.15
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        563,
        662,
        1922,
