      "char_count": 226,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.24807_p4_b5",
      "text": "iments, along with comprehensive ablations, highlighting an efficient and\nstrong alternative to SAM-PEFT baselines, VLM+SAM pipelines, large foun-\ndation models, and even strong semi-supervised methods in certain contexts.\n\u2013 We demonstrate strong empirical performance across diverse comparisons\n",
      "bbox": [
        140.99,
        248.68,
        482.61,
        294.22
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        563,
