      "char_count": 295,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.24807_p4_b6",
      "text": "and ablations, providing an efficient and competitive alternative to SAM-\nPEFT baselines, VLM+SAM pipelines, large segmentation foundation mod-\nels, and, in certain regimes, semi-supervised methods.\n",
      "bbox": [
        151.7,
        296.21,
